Changes made to ThinkingCap for that checkpoint (recorded here for the Apache-2.0 and PolyForm terms):
  model.safetensors, model.safetensors.index.json: the language-model body quantised to int4 (AWQ, asymmetric, group 128,
    compressed-tensors format); the int4 lm_head replaces the 16-bit one.
  config.json: the quantisation configuration, FP8 KV and head/drafter entries.
  kv_scales.safetensors: per-layer FP8 E4M3 KV-cache scales (new file, calibrated on the base model).
  model-mtp.safetensors: the multi-token-prediction drafter in int4 (the 16-bit drafter replaced).
  tokenizer.json, chat_template.jinja, preprocessor_config.json, video_preprocessor_config.json: not modified from the
    Qwen3.8-27B files.
  generation_config.json, tokenizer_config.json: the copies in halt95/Qwen3.8-27B-W4A16-Merlin (re-saved by transformers
    during quantisation, as in philbert's checkpoint): generation values unchanged; the tokenizer config is re-serialised,
    with the added tokens in tokenizer.json and the chat template in chat_template.jinja.
